{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1nouJKaCMoJQEQ8QWKG", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I signed off with low confidence (0.3), and none of my three reports was confirmed. The developer replied \"could not reproduce\" to each. I tested Settings, the Journal and the group editor only partly.\n\n**Reported, not confirmed:**\n- **Body weight, \"1e2\":** the editor accepted scientific notation and saved it as 100 lb.\n- **Body weight, 15510 lb:** an earlier attempt saved an absurd 15510 lb. That input was a stale-text mix-up on my side, so it is weak evidence.\n- **Group schedule preview:** a weekly, every-2-weeks schedule on Monday and Friday, starting Fri Nov 13, previewed \"Nov 16 Mon\". That date falls in the skipped week, so I expected Nov 23 instead.\n\n**Checked and fine:**\n- A comma decimal (\"70,5\") was saved as 70.5 kg.\n- The kg to lb switch converted correctly (70.5 kg showed as 155.4 lb).\n- A pinned Journal date (\"E1\", Nov 13) saved and showed in the timeline.\n- The daily every-2-days preview was right (Nov 15 after today).\n- The weekly every-1-week preview was right (Nov 20).\n\n**Not tested:**\n- Journal paging with many entries, which is the main change in this build.\n- Saving a group and reopening it.\n- Rotating the screen.\n- Reaching the editors by a second route.\n\nThe note I typed in the Journal was never saved as an entry. I didn't tap its Save button, because the keyboard's suggestion strip covered it."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 434, "cache_read_input_tokens": 38319, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 434}, "output_tokens": 521, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "